WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.583 --> 00:00:32.750
As you are understanding,

2
00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:34.041
this entire chapter

3
00:00:34.041 --> 00:00:36.416
is a detailed description of yoga.

4
00:00:36.416 --> 00:00:38.625
Lord Krishna has so far talked about

5
00:00:38.625 --> 00:00:40.583
the proper place for yoga, proper process,

6
00:00:40.583 --> 00:00:43.500
and the main purpose of yoga.

7
00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:44.833
Now here Lord Krishna

8
00:00:44.833 --> 00:00:46.791
begins to explain

9
00:00:46.791 --> 00:00:48.666
how essential it is for a yogi

10
00:00:48.666 --> 00:00:54.916
to maintain balance in the
 normal activities of life.

11
00:01:00.125 --> 00:01:02.333
Lord Krishna says in this verse

12
00:01:02.333 --> 00:01:04.166
that yoga is not for those who eat

13
00:01:04.166 --> 00:01:05.583
excessively

14
00:01:05.583 --> 00:01:07.916
or eat very little,

15
00:01:07.916 --> 00:01:11.041
nor is yoga for those who sleep excessively

16
00:01:11.041 --> 00:01:14.666
or sleep less than necessary.

17
00:01:14.666 --> 00:01:17.250
Mainly, Lord Krishna is explaining

18
00:01:17.250 --> 00:01:18.625
that if a person

19
00:01:18.625 --> 00:01:21.416
wants to progress in the direction of yoga,

20
00:01:21.416 --> 00:01:25.583
they must maintain balance 
of their body and mind.

21
00:01:25.583 --> 00:01:28.166
If we become too immersed
 in physical activities

22
00:01:28.166 --> 00:01:31.458
like eating or sleeping,

23
00:01:31.458 --> 00:01:34.166
or start ignoring them, then

24
00:01:34.166 --> 00:01:36.083
our body and mind

25
00:01:36.083 --> 00:01:39.250
won't be able to properly support yoga.

26
00:01:39.250 --> 00:01:42.166
Where on one hand, excessive eating makes the

27
00:01:42.166 --> 00:01:45.208
body sluggish and lazy,

28
00:01:45.208 --> 00:01:49.250
eating very little brings weakness.

29
00:01:49.250 --> 00:01:50.166
Also,

30
00:01:50.166 --> 00:01:53.333
these affect concentration.

31
00:01:53.333 --> 00:01:54.833
One who eats excessively

32
00:01:54.833 --> 00:01:57.041
and one who eats less than necessary –

33
00:01:57.041 --> 00:02:00.625
both their attention will keep going toward food.

34
00:02:00.625 --> 00:02:03.250
So then how will they concentrate in yoga?

35
00:02:03.250 --> 00:02:05.416
We should eat only as much food

36
00:02:05.416 --> 00:02:08.958
as is sufficient, which keeps the body nourished.

37
00:02:08.958 --> 00:02:11.083
Neither less nor more.

38
00:02:11.083 --> 00:02:14.333
Similarly, this same truth applies to sleep too.

39
00:02:14.333 --> 00:02:17.166
Excessive sleep makes us lazy,

40
00:02:17.166 --> 00:02:18.416
and incomplete sleep

41
00:02:18.416 --> 00:02:20.750
makes us experience fatigue.

42
00:02:20.750 --> 00:02:23.500
Both of these break concentration

43
00:02:23.500 --> 00:02:25.875
and distract attention.

44
00:02:25.875 --> 00:02:27.666
Krishna's message is this:

45
00:02:27.666 --> 00:02:30.041
we must maintain a proper limit

46
00:02:30.041 --> 00:02:32.041
of such physical activities

47
00:02:32.041 --> 00:02:33.416
so that we can apply our body

48
00:02:33.416 --> 00:02:37.625
and mind properly in spiritual upliftment.

49
00:02:37.625 --> 00:02:41.166
With the help of a balanced life, a yogi

50
00:02:41.166 --> 00:02:45.250
can effectively control both their body and mind.

51
00:02:45.250 --> 00:02:46.291
This balance

52
00:02:46.291 --> 00:02:49.250
also applies to other aspects of life.

53
00:02:49.250 --> 00:02:51.583
Whether it's work, rest,

54
00:02:51.583 --> 00:02:53.416
or entertainment, etc.

55
00:02:53.416 --> 00:02:54.375
Neither less,

56
00:02:54.375 --> 00:02:58.083
nor more – If less work is done,
restlessness will trouble you.

57
00:02:58.083 --> 00:03:00.541
If it's too much, craving will pull.

58
00:03:00.541 --> 00:03:03.041
Both situations will have an adverse effect

59
00:03:03.041 --> 00:03:06.208
on concentration and yoga.

60
00:03:06.208 --> 00:03:07.958
In the upcoming verses, Krishna

61
00:03:07.958 --> 00:03:09.541
will shed light in detail

62
00:03:09.541 --> 00:03:12.208
on this balanced life.

63
00:03:16.958 --> 00:03:20.541
Whether in yoga or in personal life,

64
00:03:20.541 --> 00:03:25.500
if you want to progress, understand this:

65
00:03:25.500 --> 00:03:29.875
balance is very important.

66
00:03:29.875 --> 00:03:31.875
Any instrument can give sweet

67
00:03:31.875 --> 00:03:35.250
music for a long time only

68
00:03:35.250 --> 00:03:38.750
when its string is neither too tight,

69
00:03:38.750 --> 00:03:42.041
nor too loose. If it is too

70
00:03:42.041 --> 00:03:46.416
tight, it will break after a while.

71
00:03:46.416 --> 00:03:47.458
If it's loose,

72
00:03:47.458 --> 00:03:51.291
it won't be able to produce a sweet sound.

73
00:03:51.291 --> 00:03:52.250
That's it.

74
00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:54.791
Life is like this too.

75
00:03:54.791 --> 00:03:57.250
Many people cannot achieve their goal

76
00:03:57.250 --> 00:03:59.833
for these very two reasons.

77
00:03:59.833 --> 00:04:02.541
Either they start with such intensity

78
00:04:02.541 --> 00:04:05.625
in extreme enthusiasm that then

79
00:04:05.625 --> 00:04:09.208
they get tired and break down soon, stop.

80
00:04:09.208 --> 00:04:11.791
Or else, looking at the distance of the goal,

81
00:04:11.791 --> 00:04:15.708
they think that there is still a lot of time,

82
00:04:15.708 --> 00:04:18.208
let's rest a bit.

83
00:04:18.208 --> 00:04:21.833
Both these situations are not appropriate.

84
00:04:21.833 --> 00:04:24.083
Whether it's life's goals

85
00:04:24.083 --> 00:04:27.333
or yoga, keeping both the body and mind

86
00:04:27.333 --> 00:04:32.458
healthy and balanced is essential.

87
00:04:32.458 --> 00:04:34.458
That's why this verse

88
00:04:34.458 --> 00:04:38.083
talks about food and sleep.

89
00:04:38.083 --> 00:04:41.083
If either of the two is done in excess,

90
00:04:41.083 --> 00:04:44.208
the body will become sluggish, and the mind

91
00:04:44.208 --> 00:04:47.708
will keep craving food and sleep.

92
00:04:47.708 --> 00:04:50.458
If there is a lack of either of the two,

93
00:04:50.458 --> 00:04:55.458
the body will get tired, and 
the mind won't concentrate.

94
00:04:55.458 --> 00:04:59.750
Their effect will be on both body and mind.

95
00:04:59.750 --> 00:05:03.000
Therefore, whether it's physical activities

96
00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:04.916
like food and sleep,

97
00:05:04.916 --> 00:05:07.791
or your progress toward the goal,

98
00:05:07.791 --> 00:05:11.166
neither excess is good nor lack.

99
00:05:11.166 --> 00:05:15.875
The right path is the middle one, of balance.

100
00:05:15.875 --> 00:05:18.250
Where the body also stays healthy

101
00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:21.666
and the mind can also stay concentrated.

102
00:05:26.125 --> 00:05:31.000
In today's society, there is show-off everywhere.

103
00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:34.500
Even before eating food, people

104
00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:36.541
take a picture of it.

105
00:05:36.541 --> 00:05:39.416
Try to tell everyone, "Look

106
00:05:39.416 --> 00:05:40.916
what I ate today."

107
00:05:40.916 --> 00:05:44.208
While some people proudly tell

108
00:05:44.208 --> 00:05:47.708
how much they can eat at one time.

109
00:05:47.708 --> 00:05:49.958
Food

110
00:05:49.958 --> 00:05:53.750
is a normal physical necessity.

111
00:05:53.750 --> 00:05:55.375
Why show off about it?

112
00:05:55.375 --> 00:05:58.125
There's no harm in eating good food.

113
00:05:58.125 --> 00:06:00.208
There shouldn't be an excess of it.

114
00:06:00.208 --> 00:06:02.333
There shouldn't be show-off.

115
00:06:02.333 --> 00:06:04.916
Eating more than necessary will only

116
00:06:04.916 --> 00:06:07.041
harm the body.

117
00:06:07.041 --> 00:06:09.875
While many people take pride

118
00:06:09.875 --> 00:06:11.458
and show off

119
00:06:11.458 --> 00:06:13.750
that they can work continuously

120
00:06:13.750 --> 00:06:15.583
without rest, without sleep.

121
00:06:15.583 --> 00:06:19.625
They feel this lifestyle is commendable.

122
00:06:19.625 --> 00:06:22.166
If life is moving toward excess,

123
00:06:22.166 --> 00:06:22.833
or else

124
00:06:22.833 --> 00:06:24.750
toward excessive pride

125
00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:26.875
and show-off,

126
00:06:26.875 --> 00:06:29.291
then be alert.

127
00:06:29.291 --> 00:06:31.750
Remember, this body

128
00:06:31.750 --> 00:06:36.541
is like a very, very effective tool,

129
00:06:36.541 --> 00:06:39.166
so that you can live life well,

130
00:06:39.166 --> 00:06:40.750
can progress.

131
00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:44.458
Proper care of this tool is essential.

132
00:06:44.458 --> 00:06:46.791
Food, sleep, etc. –

133
00:06:46.791 --> 00:06:49.250
all these are means

134
00:06:49.250 --> 00:06:51.166
to keep this body healthy.

135
00:06:51.166 --> 00:06:54.458
If there is an excess of them, 
the body will slow down,

136
00:06:54.458 --> 00:06:58.333
and if there is a lack of them, 
the body will get tired.

137
00:06:58.333 --> 00:07:00.708
If you really want to live a healthy

138
00:07:00.708 --> 00:07:03.416
and meaningful life,

139
00:07:03.416 --> 00:07:05.708
then give these physical activities only as much

140
00:07:05.708 --> 00:07:09.625
importance as necessary.

141
00:07:09.625 --> 00:07:11.500
Neither less nor more.

142
00:07:11.500 --> 00:07:15.208
The path of balance is the path of progress.

143
00:07:15.208 --> 00:07:17.666
Give the body proper nutrition,

144
00:07:17.666 --> 00:07:21.125
give proper rest, keep it alert,

145
00:07:21.125 --> 00:07:23.833
and instead of show-off, focus the mind

146
00:07:23.833 --> 00:07:26.875
on your purposes.

147
00:07:31.250 --> 00:07:32.916
In today's fast-paced

148
00:07:32.916 --> 00:07:35.083
professional life,

149
00:07:35.083 --> 00:07:38.333
many people take pride in the fact

150
00:07:38.333 --> 00:07:41.375
that they are extremely busy.

151
00:07:41.375 --> 00:07:44.250
So much that even sleep and food

152
00:07:44.250 --> 00:07:48.583
have to be ignored.

153
00:07:48.583 --> 00:07:52.875
If this happens only occasionally,
 it's understandable.

154
00:07:52.875 --> 00:07:56.416
But the problem arises

155
00:07:56.416 --> 00:07:59.541
when because of one person's pride,

156
00:07:59.541 --> 00:08:03.125
other people are also inspired or forced.

157
00:08:03.125 --> 00:08:08.125
Gradually this becomes 
the professional lifestyle.

158
00:08:08.125 --> 00:08:09.500
In many organizations,

159
00:08:09.500 --> 00:08:12.000
a kind of competition develops

160
00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:14.458
of who can work the longest

161
00:08:14.458 --> 00:08:17.541
without tiring, without rest.

162
00:08:17.541 --> 00:08:19.708
But the truth is,

163
00:08:19.708 --> 00:08:22.041
whether it's an individual

164
00:08:22.041 --> 00:08:26.750
or an organization, this lifestyle is harmful.

165
00:08:26.750 --> 00:08:29.875
If we talk about an individual, by doing this

166
00:08:29.875 --> 00:08:33.416
that person is taking their physical machine

167
00:08:33.416 --> 00:08:37.083
to the verge of fatigue and breakdown.

168
00:08:37.083 --> 00:08:39.291
And if we talk about the organization,

169
00:08:39.291 --> 00:08:42.125
this lifestyle is a sign

170
00:08:42.125 --> 00:08:44.583
that many people in the organization

171
00:08:44.583 --> 00:08:48.083
cannot even give time to 
their body or their family,

172
00:08:48.083 --> 00:08:50.666
are ignoring it for work.

173
00:08:50.666 --> 00:08:53.541
This will only create tension.

174
00:08:53.541 --> 00:08:54.916
And what use is

175
00:08:54.916 --> 00:08:58.166
such progress for an 
organization where employees

176
00:08:58.166 --> 00:08:59.791
are forced to even stake

177
00:08:59.791 --> 00:09:03.416
their health?

178
00:09:03.416 --> 00:09:07.375
Proper food, proper rest, family time –

179
00:09:07.375 --> 00:09:11.750
all these are fundamental necessities of life.

180
00:09:11.750 --> 00:09:13.458
Ignoring them

181
00:09:13.458 --> 00:09:16.791
is not only personally harmful, but

182
00:09:16.791 --> 00:09:20.458
it will also have adverse 
effects on the organization.

183
00:09:20.458 --> 00:09:21.833
People will start avoiding working

184
00:09:21.833 --> 00:09:24.500
in such organizations

185
00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:27.083
because there's a lack of humanity here.

186
00:09:27.083 --> 00:09:28.500
So remember,

187
00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:30.416
take care of yourself,

188
00:09:30.416 --> 00:09:32.916
and if you are a senior official,

189
00:09:32.916 --> 00:09:35.041
inspire your employees too

190
00:09:35.041 --> 00:09:38.083
to take care of themselves.

191
00:09:38.083 --> 00:09:39.666
Work is essential.

192
00:09:39.666 --> 00:09:42.166
Professional progress is also essential,

193
00:09:42.166 --> 00:09:44.791
but not at the cost of physical

194
00:09:44.791 --> 00:09:47.125
and mental stress.

195
00:09:47.125 --> 00:09:48.666
Think about it.
